<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TH" style="id">Kharam: Bible Translation 1st Edition.</book>
  <para style="ide">Unicode (UTF8)</para>
  <para style="h">2 Thessalonia</para>
  <para style="toc1">THESSALONIA Mi-ngaidiang Paul Inni Huuina Chemajia</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Thessalonia</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Thes</para>
  <para style="mt1">THESSALONIA</para>
  <para style="mt2">Mi-ngaidiang Paul Inni Huuina Chemajia</para>
  <para style="imt1">Chonglamsaat</para>
  <para style="ip">2 Thessalonia hi tirton paul in imajia eii (1:1). <char style="bk">1 Thessalonia amajiasuo nuk-ah apha sootlek leiya Paul in 2 Thessalonia hi Jisu Christa inneisuo kum soomra-nga leikhat pheiweiya imajia eii. </char>Hiwa larik amajia phahin Paul hi Corinth khan alaleiom. Hiwa larik hi Paul in woini huuina Pathian chuonkatho (missionary) asina lamma iphun Thessalonica koisuok diang imajia eii (Chuon 17:1-10). Tirton ngai Chuontho larik khan hiwa koisuok hi Jihudi lekkhat li Greek mi katamtak inchunliya inbool koisuok eii tiya aril.</para>
  <para style="ip">Thessalonia koisuok mi ngai'n aheknasi nikhuo khat-um Christa juokirnasik jarra inthiarra inleijetzoot jarra Paul in 1 Thessalonia khat-um 2 Thessalonia larik hin hiwa jarra katamkhat amajia. 2 Thessalonia larik hin katamkhat chu ahekna nikhuo jarra Paul in tam amajia. Tirton Paul in hiwa larik hin akadool kha emaru takkha mi rakip in inwon sipnasik chuon kathokha eru tia chongthakna um anei (3:6-10).</para>
  <para style="iot">Asuungnga kaom Chong</para>
  <para style="io1">1. Paul apumtak khat-um achuon thopui mi ngaikha malarna anei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 1:1-2">1:1-2</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">2. Hiwa thengli Paul in Thessalonica koisuok ngaikha Pathian diang aminpaak halli Pathian diang nipina anei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 1:3-12">1:3-12</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">3. Paul in ahekna nikhuo jarra rilna anei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 2:1-17">2:1-17</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">4. Paul in akadool emaru takkha chuon kangar eru tiya rilna anei <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 3:1-15">3:1-15</ref>)</char></para>
  <para style="io1">5. Insuona Chong <char style="ior">(<ref loc="2TH 3:16-18">3:16-18</ref>)</char></para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TH 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 1:1" />Paul, Silas khat-um Timothy,</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TH 1:1">Thessalonica ah kaom nipa Pathian khat-um Pumi Jisu Christa mi ka-eii koisuok ngaidiang: <char style="rq"><ref loc="ACT 17:1">Chuon 17:1</ref> </char><verse eid="2TH 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 1:2" />Nipa Pathian khat-um Pumi Jisu Christa diangnga inphut nangni chungnga riangwai khat-um kahoi kadai kha omrase.<verse eid="2TH 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Christa Juoni Chongtan</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 1:3" />Ule naingai, eini'n apha rakip-ah nangnisik bit-ah Pathian niminpaaksik eii. Ajarchu hiwahi eini'n thosik-ah rahoi suok, ajarchu nangni ngamna kha hong-insoon halli nangni rakip in inkhatli inkhat ning-inriang kha-um ahonglok. <verse eid="2TH 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 1:4" />Khawa jarra keini kinpum tak-in Pathian koisuokngai diang nangni jarra in-orna kinnei. Nangni'n ningtongpui poongraalna rakip-ah ningdei khat-um ngamna ningcheet jarra um in-orna kinnei.<verse eid="2TH 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 1:5" />Hiwa rakip ngai'n Pathian chongtan khachu adik tia amalar, nangni'n ningpoong khan ajar-eya Pathian rengram sik-ah nangni rahoi ning-eii. <verse eid="2TH 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 1:6" />Pathian chu akadik kha eii: nangni kanaminpoong ngaikha ama'n aminpoongsik eii, <verse eid="2TH 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 1:7" />halli ama'n keini poongna khat-um nangni poongna kha anakhaipisik eii. Hiwahi ama'n Pumi Jisu kha marwaan makheiya ranak kangar ama marwaan tirton ngaikha mei machuon le inruoiya ajuoni khan, <verse eid="2TH 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 1:8" />Pathian kajetmak khat-um Pumi Jisu chongkahoi kajuimak mi ngai khachu ama'n mei le inruoiya arachaak sik eii.<verse eid="2TH 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 1:9" />Inmani khachu Pumi makheiya inlaak khat-um ama lurna lianna ranak makheiya inlaak kumsoot mangna kha inmusik eii, <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 2:10">Isa 2:10</ref></char><verse eid="2TH 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 1:10" />ama mi rakip diang lurna lianna khat-um ama ka-ngamna rakip diang khoya kaleisik-ah ajuo Nikhuo nikhan, nangni um inmani karra ning-inchelsik eii ajarchu nangnidiang kinril chongpui kha nangni'n ngamna ningneijei.<verse eid="2TH 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 1:11" />Khawa jarra keini'n nangni sik-ah inchat lekleiya Pathian diang kinni. Pathian nakoina ringkhuo khan nangni'n rahoi ka-eya ningring matornasik keini'n Pathian diang kinnanipi. Nangni i-ngaidon akatha rakip khat-um nangni ngamna kaom chuon ngaikha ama ranak khan huui namintungpi erase. <verse eid="2TH 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 1:12" />Hinthoa Eini Pumi Jisu raming kha nangni diangnga inphut lurna lianna kha amusik eii, halli eini Pathian khat-um Pumi Jisu Christa riangwai jarra inphut nangni'n lurna lianna kha amadiang makheiya ningmusik eii.<verse eid="2TH 1:12" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TH 2" />
  <para style="s1">Manu Mi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 2:1" />Eini Pumi Jisu Christa akajuosik halli eini'n amadiang ni-inchunsik jarra, kei'n ule nai nangnidiang hiwa ngaihi kanaminthozoot, <char style="rq"><ref loc="1TH 4:15-17">1 Thes 4:15-17</ref> </char><verse eid="2TH 2:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 2:2" />khachu ratha-ah erase, chongpuiya erase, emakli keini imajia chongnga erase, Pumi Nikhuo kha ajuojei iti chongkhan nangni innottheiya ningmalung mindongmaru khat-um ningka-iit kha emaru. <verse eid="2TH 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 2:3" />Tuteii innum maleisei thoa nangni kha ang rakip-ah lamleiitiang inruoimaru. Ajarchu ahekna kathamak pha heiwa masa makleiseng halli meikhurra kaluutsik Manu Mi kha inlarmasa maklaiseng khawa Nikhuo kha heiwanuni.<verse eid="2TH 2:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 2:4" />Ama'n chubei thosik ah rahoi ka-eii Pathian emakli phur rakip kha zootnuni halli apum takkha hiwangai rakip chungnga inchoisaang. Ama'n sita Pathian biak-inn khannum in-ongta Pathian ka eii atisik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="DAN 11:36">Dan 11:36</ref>; <ref loc="EZK 28:2">Ezek 28:2</ref></char><verse eid="2TH 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 2:5" />Nangni'n ngaidonmakchu bejei? Kei'n nangnile kalei omlai hiwangai rakip hi nangnidiang kei'n kaleiriljei. <verse eid="2TH 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 2:6" />Hiwahi tuun laminsuok maknasik ook-ah kaom inkhat om halli khawa kha nangni'n ningjetjei, apha chei tinikhan Manu Mi kha inlarsik eii. <verse eid="2TH 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 2:7" />Inthup ah kaom Manu Mi ranak kha tuun chuon athoa omjei, takkha tuun aka-ook ama kha lam makheiya inkhaimaklaiseng akasuoksik kha lasuoknuni.<verse eid="2TH 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 2:8" />Halli khawapha khanchu Manu Mi kha malarsik ejei, takkha Pumi Jisu ajuoni khan, Manu Mi kha Pumi mur makheiya aphuksaan ranakkhan ama kha athatsik eii halli Pumi ra-aang khan Manu Mi kha aminmangsik eii. <char style="rq"><ref loc="ISA 11:4">Isa 11:4</ref></char><verse eid="2TH 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 2:9" />Manu Mi khan Seitan ranak-ah heiwata kadikmak inlakchuon khat-um ngak kaom angjet ngaikha athosik eii, <char style="rq"><ref loc="MAT 24:24">Matt 24:24</ref></char><verse eid="2TH 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 2:10" />halli Pathian kajetmak kamangnga kaom mi ngaidiang rilkacha maleisei angjet arilsik eii. Inmani ngaikha inthisik eii ajarchu ringna sik-ah akadikkha inmalungnga keiluutmu. <verse eid="2TH 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 2:11" />Hiwa jarra inmani'n akadikmak kha ngamnarasu tia Pathian in akadikmak ranak kha inmani diang chuon katho sik-ah ijuotir eii. <verse eid="2TH 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 2:12" />Ajuotirna ajarchu akadik kha kangamnamak, takkha akathamak kamanuom mi rakip kha minmangnasik eii.<verse eid="2TH 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sanminringna sik-ah nangni Inakadang eii</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 2:13" />Pumi'n inaminriang ule naingai, nangni sik bit-ah keini'n inchatlekleiya Pathian minpaaksik rahoi eii. Ajarchu Pathian'n nangni kha sanminringna sik-ah Ratha ranak-ah khat-um akadik kha ningngamna jarra ama sik-ah inthiang mi ngai namin-enasik mansakhet-ah<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:13. </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mansakhet; </char><char style="ft" closed="false">manuscript lekkhat achu </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">inphutna makheiya tia injia.</char></note> inakadang kha ning-ejei. <verse eid="2TH 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 2:14" />Eini Pumi Jisu Christa lurna lianna khan tum ningchang nasik-ah, Pathian'n nangnikha keini'n kinril chongkahoi khan inakoi kha eii. <verse eid="2TH 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 2:15" />Khawa jarra, ule naingai, kacheet-ah ngirru halli kinmurra kinril emakli kinmajia chongnga keini'n nangnidiang kinnaminchu akadik ngaikha kacheet-ah mahuumru.<verse eid="2TH 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 2:16" />Eini kanaminriang halli ama riangwai khan masokna khat-um ngamna kacheet kanapeii eini Pumi Jisu Christa khat-um nipa Pathian in <verse eid="2TH 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 2:17" />nangnikha kumsoot akatha katho khat-um akadik karil ning-enasik bit-ah nasongpui khat-um na-ngirpui kha erase.<verse eid="2TH 2:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TH 3" />
  <para style="s1">Keini sik Pathian diang Nanipiru</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TH 3:1" />Ahekna khet-ah, ule naingai, nangni diang aleikasuok kha angnga, Pumi chongkahoi hi innottheiya khat-um kalurra inkeiluut nasik-ah keini sik-ah Pathian diang nanipiru. <verse eid="2TH 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TH 3:2" />Pathian in keini hi manu khat-um akathamak mi ngai diangnga inphut anasan nasik-um Pathian nanipiru, ajarchu mi rakip in chongkahoi hi ka-ngamna emu.<verse eid="2TH 3:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TH 3:3" />Takkha Pumi chu ngamna kaom eii, halli ama'n nangni kha anamin-ngarsik khat-um Seitan diangnga inphut anasansik eii. <verse eid="2TH 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TH 3:4" />Keini'n Pumi diang nangni jarra ngamna kinnei, khachu nangni'n ningtho khat-um nangnidiang thoru kinti ngaikha thochei ningte tiya kinlei.<verse eid="2TH 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TH 3:5" />Pathian minriangna khat-um Christa in poongraal ideikha incheen doomma ningjetnasik Pumi'n nangni kha nanruoipui erase.<verse eid="2TH 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Thosik Kasuok Chuon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TH 3:6" />Ule naingai, akadool ule nai khat-um keini naleipeii dan ngaikha akajuimak inmani rakip makheiya inphut kalaak-ak omru tia eini Pumi Jisu Christa ramingnga chongpeii hi nangnidiang kinda. <verse eid="2TH 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TH 3:7" />Nangni'n keini omchan ngaikha angtho tholia ningjutsikme tikha ningjetjei. Keini'n nangnile kinom laikhan eini akadool kha emakmi. <verse eid="2TH 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TH 3:8" />Keini'n tuteii bukha aman pelekleiya bakmung, takkha nangni tuteii diang-um phurrik emaknasik keini'n inchatlekleiya suunli zaan boiya chuon kintho. <verse eid="2TH 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TH 3:9" />Hiwa kinthona jarhi, keini'n nangni diang nasanru kinti nasik kinrei ommak jarra emak, takkha nangni juisik-ah abi inkhat kindazoot-ah kintho eii. <verse eid="2TH 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TH 3:10" />Keini'n nangnile kinlei omlai, keini'n nangni diang kinleiti kachak, “Chuon kathomak mi kha bak marase.”<verse eid="2TH 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TH 3:11" />Nangni karra chuon tholekleiya, chor intiya halkaom, akadool miring lekkhat inom tihi keini'n kinjet. <verse eid="2TH 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TH 3:12" />Khawa mi ngaidiang keini'n Pumi Jisu Christa ramingnga omchian inlang chuon tho-inlang ringnasik chuon thoru tia kinmasok khat-um chongpeii kinda.<verse eid="2TH 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TH 3:13" />Ule naingai, chuon katha katho sik kapoongkha emaru. <verse eid="2TH 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TH 3:14" />Hiwa chemajia larik hinna juisik-ah kinleida kajuimak miring lekkhat omthei eii, khawa mi ngaikha katha-ah jetru halli inmani ngaikha jakna inmunasik inmani khale inlopmaru. <verse eid="2TH 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TH 3:15" />Takkha inhalpui mit-enna inmani ngaikha enmaru; khawa rathuulla, ule nai mit-enna minchuru.<verse eid="2TH 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ahekna Chongda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TH 3:16" />Akahoi akadai thutbul, Pumi ama tak-in, chuon rakip-ah khat-um apha rakip-ah akahoi akadai kha inapeii erase. Pumi'n nangni rakip nanruoipuichak erase.<verse eid="2TH 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TH 3:17" />Kei'n hiwa inpaakna chonghi kakut tak-in kimajia kha eii. Kacheii majia rakip-ah Paul kei'n katia jetnabi kadeeng; hin thoa kei'n kamajia.<verse eid="2TH 3:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TH 3:18" />Eini Pumi Jisu Christa riangwai kha nangni rakip chungnga omrase.<verse eid="2TH 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TH 3" />
</usx>